        "Compare spend between periods",
        "Read spend from the BI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "campaigns",
      "name": "Campaigns",
      "description": "Builder, targeting, publishing, ad controls and publishing reliability.",
      "examples": [
        "Publish a campaign",
        "Test Ads Manager selectors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "landing",
      "name": "Landing Pages & Tracking",
      "description": "Landing pages, hosting, QA, domains, Keitaro and tracking links.",
      "examples": [
        "Manage tracking domains",
        "Copy a landing page"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "creatives",
      "name": "Creatives & Content",
      "description": "Text libraries, creative analysis, briefs, headlines and material generation.",
      "examples": [
        "Generate headlines from winning ads",
        "Share the ad text library"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "platform",
      "name": "Platform & Operations",
